===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[unplanned]] or [[unexpected]] [[meeting]].
#: ''Their encounter was a matter of chance
# A [[hostile]] meeting; a [[confrontation]] or [[skirmish]].
# A sudden, often violent [[clash]], as between combattants

